// The two PyMuPDF helper scripts are bundled here as base64 so they can be
// written to disk on demand. Obsidian's community-plugin installer only ships
// main.js / manifest.json / styles.css, so loose *.py files in the repo never
// reach the user's machine. The "Install bundled Python scripts" command
// decodes these and writes them next to main.js (the plugin folder).
//
// To regenerate after editing the .py files, re-run the build step that
// produced this file (base64 of layout_engine.py and pdf_export.py).

